209	     * owner's level cannot exceed one above the maximum level among the other members of its
210	     * household. Not a persisted column — populated by the create pipeline, which alone has the
211	     * repository access to read the household's members. {@code null} when no cap applies (the
212	     * owner has no existing household member), leaving the level uncapped.
213	     */
