239	    /**
240	     * Whether this owner has been soft-deleted. A soft-delete ({@code DELETE /api/owners/{id}})
241	     * flags the owner deleted and retains the row rather than removing it, so the owner is still
242	     * returned by a fetch; the create pipeline's duplicate and identity checks ignore owners
243	     * flagged deleted. A newly created owner is not deleted.
244	     */
